OL,3,GNEWSASignage to be removed from former
OL,4,ARadio City tower
OL,5,
OL,6,FSignage on one of Liverpool's most
OL,7,Frecognisable landmarks is set to be
OL,8,Fremoved after more than 25 years.
OL,10,FA planning application has been lodged
OL,11,Fwith Liverpool City Council to take
OL,12,Fdown the Radio City 96.7 logo from St
OL,13,FJohns Beacon, which was installed in
OL,14,Fthe year 2000.
OL,16,FThe local radio station Radio City was
OL,17,Fbroadcast from the grade II listed
OL,18,F450ft tower until 2024, when it was
OL,19,Frelocated and rebranded Hits Radio.
OL,20,FSince then the building has been empty.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
