OL,3,GNEWSASignage to be removed from former
OL,4,ARadio City tower
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf approved, the sign would be replaced
OL,7,Fby a new animated LED screen, which the
OL,8,Fdeveloper applicant said would "improve
OL,9,Fthe visual quality of the signage as
OL,10,Fvisible both during the day and in
OL,11,Fdarkness".
